# My Project

_Copy this file to `MY_PROJECT.md` (no `.template` suffix) and fill it in.
The drill-down engine reads `MY_PROJECT.md` at Step 1 (Seed)._

## Brief (required)

_2–3 sentences. What is the product? Who is it for? What is the single most
important outcome?_

Example: _"A team todo app for small remote teams (3–20 people). Members
organize work into shared workspaces and see real-time updates. Success
means a team can replace a spreadsheet + Slack thread with it in one day."_

